category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libexpat-devel libicu-devel libinih-devel
sdesc: "Library to handle RPG Maker 2000/2003 and EasyRPG projects (utilities)"
ldesc: "liblcf is a library to handle RPG Maker 2000 and 2003 game data.
It can read and write LCF and XML files."
